[12.998192, "o", "tarnpit\r\nhopcue\r\nwatchbay\r\n"]
[12.998535, "o", "--- VERBS ---\r\n"]
[12.999899, "o", "kindle\r\n  rebuild ship.jar and draft.jar from current sources\r\n\r\nwatch BAG\r\n  run the ship mill on BAG and write /app/jarhearth/watch.json\r\n\r\npeek BAG\r\n  print the gather word for BAG as one integer on stdout\r\n\r\ndraft BAG\r\n  run the draft mill on BAG\r\n"]
[13.000414, "o", "--- CARD ---\r\n"]
[13.001436, "o", "watch.json on a successful watch:\r\n  seen — integer gather word from the packed mill\r\n  bag — hopbag path given on the command line\r\n  note — kiln stamp taken from MARK.txt\r\n\r\nThe mill stores the wait-board integer the gatherer publishes onto the packed mill. That integer is not the first-line token of the hopbag. A never-publish bag (first-line integer 0) is not a published bag; watch must not write a success ledger for it.\r\n\r\nGrade-time bags may sit outside /app/hopbags. One of those bags is also named on this card as /app/hopbags/elm.bag.\r\n"]
[13.007396, "o", "--- MARK ---\r\n"]
[13.010713, "o", "keld-tight-9\r\n"]
[13.012334, "o", "--- NOTES ---\r\n"]
[13.016593, "o", "/app/opslip/NOTES.txt\r\n"]
[13.024732, "o", "--- /app/opslip/NOTES.txt\r\n"]
[13.027154, "o", "Draft mill finishes on the same bags the ship mill leaves at 0.\r\nShip hangs or returns the opening zero while kindle still exits 0.\r\nA nap helper lives under softmill from an old hang drill; it is unused by the packed mill.\r\n/app/opslip/jarscan.py\r\n"]
[13.030003, "o", "--- /app/opslip/jarscan.py\r\n"]
[13.032528, "o", "import zipfile\r\nfrom pathlib import Path\r\n\r\n\r\ndef read_stamp(jar: Path) -> str:\r\n    with zipfile.ZipFile(jar) as z:\r\n        if \"STAMP\" not in z.namelist():\r\n            return \"\"\r\n        return z.read(\"STAMP\").decode().strip()\r\n\u001b[?2004hroot@4f635ef6fe85:/app# "]
[13.272491, "i", "printf '%s\\n' '--- TREE ---'; find /app -maxdepth 4 -type f -printf '%p\\n' | sort; printf '%s\\n' '--- CINDERWAIT ---'; file /app/bin/cinderwait; sed -n '1,240p' /app/bin/cinderwait\n"]
[13.275514, "o", "printf '%s\\n' '--- TREE ---'; find /app -maxdepth 4 -type f -printf '%p\\n' | sort; printf '%s\\n' '--- CINDERWAIT ---'; file /app/bin/cinderwait; sed -n '1,240p' /app/bin/cinderwait\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r--- TREE ---\r\n"]
